   Homio REOS (Android)

  HOMIO — Global AI-Powered Real Estate Operating System (REOS) built with Kotlin and Jetpack Compose.

  ## Key Features & Architecture

  • Control Center & Executive KPIs: Real-time monitoring of active leads, genuine qualification ratios, inventory
  units, protected commission ledger, system trust index, and state hash verification.
  • Architecture Gates (ARCH-001 – ARCH-039): Interactive state machine tracking all 39 architecture milestones,
  subtask execution, acceptance criteria validation, and state sealing.
  • Lead Engine & Attribution: First-touch cryptographic attribution (SHA-256), AI-powered genuine score evaluation
  (0–100), and anti-bypass builder notification.
  • Developer Inventory & Deal Protection: Live unit status tracking (available, blocked, sold), developer portfolio
  management, and commission bond agreements with dispute protection.
  • Evidence Ledger & Security Tripwires: Immutable logs for geofenced site visit OTPs, digital consent mandates,
  automated tripwire circuit breakers, and autonomous agent roles.

  ## Tech Stack

  • Language: Kotlin 2.0
  • UI Toolkit: Jetpack Compose & Material 3
  • Architecture: MVVM with Kotlin Coroutines & Reactive StateFlow
  • Platform: Android SDK 35+ / Material You Dynamic Theming



